000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.    TDISPBAS.
000400 INSTALLATION.  GOODYEAR TIRE & RUBBER CO.
000500*REMARKS.   THIS PROGRAM DISPLAYS A VERBAL WORK ORDER;
000600*                   SOFT KEY F1 CONTINUES AN EXISTING DISPLAY,
000700*                   SOFT KEY F2 REQUESTS NEW WORK ORDER NUMBER,
000800*               SOFT KEY F4 DISPLAYS BASIC WORK ORDER,
000900*               SOFT KEY F5 DISPLAYS NONPURCHASED MATERIALS,
001000*               SOFT KEY F6 DISPLAYS PURCHASED MATERIALS,
001100*               SOFT KEY F7 DISPLAYS LABOR USED,
001300*                   SOFT KEY F3 EXITS PROGRAM.
001400*          SUBROUTINES CALLED:
001500*              TALWONO
001600*              TSCRPRNT
001700*              ****.
      *C 02/02/93    RESOLVED PROBLEM IN 652-PREREAD-CMATLS-ORDERED AND
      *C             653-PREREAD-UMATLS-ORDERDED.  THE PROGRAM BECAME
      *C             LOCKED IN A INFINITE LOOP IF THE USER SELECTED TO
      *C             DISPLAY A NON-PURCHASED MATERIAL BUT ENTERED A REQ
      *C             NUMBER FOR A PURCHASED MATERIAL AND VICE VERSA.
      *C                                            MARVIN MITCHELL.
      *C 09/10/96  JEFF BUNGO
      *C   EXPAND DATE FIELDS FOR YEAR 2000 COMPLIANCE.
      *C   RECOMPILE TO PICK UP COPYLIB CHANGES.
      *C
001800 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
001900 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
002000 SOURCE-COMPUTER.    AS400.
002100 OBJECT-COMPUTER.    AS400.
       SPECIAL-NAMES. I-O-FEEDBACK IS I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA
                      LOCAL-DATA IS LOCAL-DATA-AREA.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT DISPLAY-FILE
               ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-ZDISPLAY-SI
               ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
               ACCESS IS SEQUENTIAL
               FILE STATUS IS DSPLY-STATUS
               CONTROL-AREA IS WS-CONTROL.
002800     SELECT LBRFILE
002900         ASSIGN TO DATABASE-LBRFI
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
003000         ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
003100         RECORD KEY IS ACT-KEYL
               FILE STATUS IS LBRF-STATUS.
003200     SELECT MATFILE
003300         ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MATFI
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
003400         ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
003500         RECORD KEY IS ACT-KEYM
               FILE STATUS IS MATF-STATUS.
           SELECT WO-LABOR-FILE
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLMM1301
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                   WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS WLF-STATUS.
           SELECT WO-LAST-NUM-USED
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFPMM0800
               ORGANIZATION IS RELATIVE
               ACCESS MODE IS RANDOM
               RELATIVE KEY IS ARG-NO
               FILE STATUS IS WOLN-STATUS.
           SELECT WO-PARTS-FILE
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLMM1201
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                   WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS WPF-STATUS.
