       FD  WO-LAST-NUM-USED
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD
           DATA RECORD IS WLNU.
       01  WLNU.
           COPY DD-MCRPMM0800 OF MCFPMM0800.
       FD  WO-PARTS-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD
           DATA RECORD IS WOPARF.
       01  WOPARF.
           COPY DD-MCRPMM1200 OF MCFLMM1201.
